    {
      "id": "httpbase-017",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "HTTP 与 Web 基础",
      "knowledgePoint": "缓存no-cache",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "响应 Cache-Control: no-cache 是否等于禁止缓存存储响应？",
      "answer": "不等于；不带字段参数的 no-cache 允许存储，但复用前必须成功验证。",
      "explanation": "它与 no-store 的要求不同。",
      "example": "浏览器缓存内容后每次复用前验证。",
      "tags": [
        "缓存no-cache",
        "HTTP 与 Web 基础"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html#section-5.2.2.4"
