    {
      "id": "httpbase-018",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "HTTP 与 Web 基础",
      "knowledgePoint": "缓存no-store",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "响应 Cache-Control: no-store 对缓存有什么要求？",
      "answer": "缓存不得存储该直接请求或响应的任何部分，也不得用该响应满足其他请求。",
      "explanation": "它不能保证不受不遵守规范的缓存或其他记录方式影响。",
      "example": "对敏感响应设置 no-store。",
      "tags": [
        "缓存no-store",
        "HTTP 与 Web 基础"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html#section-5.2.2.5"
